    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/677b2972a75ca7f642eb47d20bc2e82d.avif?t=1753900901\" width=299 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cadence Point is an explorative, lore-driven game that takes place in stores and backrooms of Cadence Point mall. Explore the mall's west wing, reconnect new storefronts to the power grid, and discover the story of the mall through it's computer systems within a variety of unique and unsettling levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cadence Point- Our Marketplace, Your Time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/f2f5b31284a3eec827463160adc34cfd.avif?t=1753900901\" width=97 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/a647b13ba44bf064824e6ebd90c1c20a.avif?t=1753900901\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the mall's West Wing, it's backrooms, and utilize the mall's custom operating system to gain access to new storefronts and the levels within. Each new terminal screen, generator, and level builds the story of Cadence Point Marketplace, and it's anomalous history, around the player at their own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/297b3e8a45a37d21c2cc72b6fe1aad83.avif?t=1753900901\" width=131 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/c8c14cfe98203e6a9a57814a6a30fd7e.avif?t=1753900901\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new storefront in Cadence Point transports the player into a unique and unsettling time period to explore abandoned offices, unsettling pool rooms, and vacant hotels among many more. Accessing each storefront will take time and puzzle solving skills, which grant access to new parts of the mall, and whatever lurks within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/5cd881fc8ac794bbb91ad3678ebcdc5f.avif?t=1753900901\" width=149 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/916b131f81a87eaa65aabca5b1035701.avif?t=1753900901\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once power has been restored to the mall's West Wing, the player can utilize the facilities tactile computer terminals running Cadence OS to operate the facility. Players use their own keyboard and mouse to operate the terminals to unlock new new levels, open new areas of the mall, and discover secrets, puzzles, and lore through the Cadence OS email system.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/677b2972a75ca7f642eb47d20bc2e82d.avif?t=1753900901\" width=299 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cadence Point is an explorative, lore-driven game that takes place in stores and backrooms of Cadence Point mall. Explore the mall's west wing, reconnect new storefronts to the power grid, and discover the story of the mall through it's computer systems within a variety of unique and unsettling levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cadence Point- Our Marketplace, Your Time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/f2f5b31284a3eec827463160adc34cfd.avif?t=1753900901\" width=97 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/a647b13ba44bf064824e6ebd90c1c20a.avif?t=1753900901\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the mall's West Wing, it's backrooms, and utilize the mall's custom operating system to gain access to new storefronts and the levels within. Each new terminal screen, generator, and level builds the story of Cadence Point Marketplace, and it's anomalous history, around the player at their own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/297b3e8a45a37d21c2cc72b6fe1aad83.avif?t=1753900901\" width=131 height=33 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/c8c14cfe98203e6a9a57814a6a30fd7e.avif?t=1753900901\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new storefront in Cadence Point transports the player into a unique and unsettling time period to explore abandoned offices, unsettling pool rooms, and vacant hotels among many more. Accessing each storefront will take time and puzzle solving skills, which grant access to new parts of the mall, and whatever lurks within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/5cd881fc8ac794bbb91ad3678ebcdc5f.avif?t=1753900901\" width=149 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869000/extras/916b131f81a87eaa65aabca5b1035701.avif?t=1753900901\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once power has been restored to the mall's West Wing, the player can utilize the facilities tactile computer terminals running Cadence OS to operate the facility. Players use their own keyboard and mouse to operate the terminals to unlock new new levels, open new areas of the mall, and discover secrets, puzzles, and lore through the Cadence OS email system.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Cadence Point- Our Marketplace, Your Time. There's something on offer for every shopper with our array of vendors and store fronts, with modern facilities to take the stress out of shopping with included food court and welcome centre should you need a helping hand...",
